messages.content:
The 24 test failures are due to `AuthWrapper` replacing children (landing page content) with sign-in screen for unauthenticated users. Currently:

```tsx
// AuthWrapper.tsx line 63
if (!authenticated) {
  return (
    <div> // sign-in UI only
      {/* tagline, value prop, "Sign in" button */}
    </div>
  );
}

// Never renders children for unauthenticated users
// User is authenticated, show the Dashboard component
return <DashboardDynamic />;
```

To fix landing tests, I need to:
1. Show landing page content (`children`) when unauthenticated
2. Keep current sign-in prompt functionality (maybe as overlay or below content)
3. Still redirect authenticated users to Dashboard

Let me check if the layout is used by app.tsx:

